{"sections":[{"slug":"大Zariski意象","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"大Zariski意象"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">大</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“大 Zariski 意象”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">大</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">意象体现了</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">的点函子哲学</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">看来</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">一个概形就是一个从</span> $\\mathsf {Ring}$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\mathsf {Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的函子</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另见</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Zariski意象","text":"Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">使用经典概形理论的构造</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">使用经典概形理论</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">基概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的大</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">意象</span> $\\operatorname{Zar}(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">可定义为</span> Grothendieck "},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf {Sch}/X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">也即函子</span> $F\\colon (\\mathsf {Sch}/X)^{\\text{op}} \\to\\mathsf {Set}$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足关于</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">覆盖的粘合条件</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}